<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>CNBC 实时热点</title><link>https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&amp;id=100727362</link><description>CNBC 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:30:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>标准普尔警告英伟达信用评级可能因“上升”的管理和治理风险而被下调</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html</link><description>标准普尔全球评级表示，英伟达的信用评级可能会被下调一级，因为它指出这家芯片制造商的管理和治理风险“上升”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html'&gt;标准普尔警告英伟达信用评级可能因“上升”的管理和治理风险而被下调&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P warns Nvidia credit rating could be cut over 'rising' management and governance risk&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/nvidia-market-governance-risk.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:19:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</link><description>在华尔街隔夜从盘中低点大幅反弹后，亚太市场周四开盘走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html'&gt;由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asia-Pacific markets close higher as investors look past fresh U.S. tariffs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:00:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>获得诺贝尔奖的科学将“集水”变成一场商业竞赛</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/atmospheric-water-harvesting-nobel-prize-atoco-ahbstra/</link><description>初创公司 Atoco 和 Ahbstra 正在将空气制水机转向商业用途，包括数据中心和遭受干旱影响的社区。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/atmospheric-water-harvesting-nobel-prize-atoco-ahbstra/'&gt;获得诺贝尔奖的科学将“集水”变成一场商业竞赛&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Nobel-winning science turning ‘water harvesting’ into a commercial race&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/atmospheric-water-harvesting-nobel-prize-atoco-ahbstra/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:06:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>挑战星链：欧洲最大卫星工厂开业，与马斯克竞争</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html</link><description>这座占地2万平方米的巨型工厂每年将能够生产多达500颗卫星，使其成为世界第三大卫星生产基地。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html'&gt;挑战星链：欧洲最大卫星工厂开业，与马斯克竞争&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Taking on Starlink: Europe’s largest satellite factory opens in push to rival Musk&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/starlink-satellites-aerospacelab-factory-belgium.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:45:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国加征关税威胁给合作伙伴带来签署贸易协议的压力</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/us-tariffs-hike-trade-agreement.html</link><description>美国计划对 14 个贸易伙伴征收新关税，同时向一些国家提供更低的税率，如果它们与华盛顿达成贸易协议。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/us-tariffs-hike-trade-agreement.html'&gt;美国加征关税威胁给合作伙伴带来签署贸易协议的压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：U.S. tariff-hike threats pile pressure on partners to sign trade deals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/us-tariffs-hike-trade-agreement.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:09:39 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>